# The Corner Shop's endpoints, one request each, for the API panel (and VS Code's REST Client
# or JetBrains' HTTP Client). Paths are relative to the server, which listens on the port it
# prints (the workspace's PORT). Sent top to bottom on a fresh start, each request gets what
# its > lines say.

### The catalog
GET /products

> status 200
> json $[0].sku == "P001"

### Add two oat milks to cart r1
POST /cart/r1/items?sku=P001&qty=2

> status 200
> json $.id == "r1"

### The cart
GET /cart/r1

> status 200
> json $.items[0].sku == "P001"

### Use a coupon
POST /cart/r1/coupon?code=SAVE10

> status 200
> json $.coupon == "SAVE10"

### The totals, for a San Francisco zip
GET /cart/r1/totals?zip=94103

> status 200
> json $.subtotal == "5.98"
> json $.discount == "0.60"
> json $.total == "13.27"

### Check out
POST /checkout/r1?zip=94103

> status 201
> json $.cartId == "r1"
